{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Your silver.</b> By way of parable concerning the judges and the officers; therefore after it: \"your officers are rebellious.\" And the meaning: the choicest among them are dross." "The heh of <b>מהול</b> is a root letter, and it has no cognate in Scripture."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:53.481983548Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}